<title>SPAIN: Sevillana 9-mth net profit up 12.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Sevillana 9-mth net profit up 12.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sevillana de Electricidad results for the nine months to end-September in billions of pesetas, unless stated:</p>
<p> Net profit				  14.19  up  12.9 pct</p>
<p> Operating margin			  33.54  up  14.4 pct</p>
<p>NOTE: Demand in Sevillana's market rose 4.1 percent in the period, the firm said.</p>
<p>Financial costs fell 32.2 percent due to lower debt and interest rate charges.</p>
<p>Sevillana said it invested almost 33 billion pesetas in Andalusia based on income generated.</p>
<p>Loans fell 58.9 percent, mainly because of the securitisation of the nuclear moratoria assets, it said.</p>
</text>
